<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#DataProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, clause 5.10, which describes the transformation of input data into output data without giving it an entry of its own. The class collects the steps that transformation is made of, and carries the wording of the standard as an alternative label."@en .
